name: "cryogenic-frontiers"
displayName: "[#6ecdec]Cryogenic Frontiers[]"
author: "sonip362"
description: '''
A cryogenic technology expansion mod for Mindustry.
Unlocks the untapped potential of Cryofluid with solid Cryo-Crystals, sub-zero weaponry, thermodynamic stirling power generators, and reactive freezing fortifications.

Features:
- New Materials: Cryo-Crystal, Cryo-Alloy (superconducting cryogenic alloy)
- New Logistics (Solid): Cryo Conveyor (balanced low-friction belt), Cryo Router, Distributor (2x2), Junction, Bridge
- New Logistics (Liquid): Cryo Conduit (super-insulated duct, solidifies slag), Liquid Router, Tank (2x2), Liquid Junction, Liquid Bridge
- New Production & Coolant: Cryo-Crystallizer, Industrial Cryo-Crystallizer, Cryo-Alloy Foundry, Cryo Freezer (produces Chilled Water universal turret coolant)
- New Drills: Cryo Drill (3x3 rapid subzero drill), Titan Drill (5x5 colossal tier-5 excavator)
- New Turrets: Frostbite, Permafrost, Absolute Zero, Glacialis, Blizzard, Avalanche
- New Power & Defense: Thermo-Stirling Engine, Zero-Point Cryo-Reactor, Cryo Walls
- New Units & Command: Cryo Unit Factory, Boreas assault interceptor, Core: Frost with Frost Alpha starting unit
'''
version: "1.4.0"
minGameVersion: "136"
hidden: false
